  "meta": {
    "title": "How Hawaii Became Part of the USA 🇺🇸🌺🤯",
    "description": "Hawaii 🌺 is a US state in the middle of the Pacific, but it used to be an independent kingdom 👑 In 1893 a group of mostly American businessmen, backed by US sailors and Marines, overthrew Queen Liliʻuokalani, who surrendered to avoid bloodshed. The United States annexed Hawaii in 1898, it became a territory in 1900 and a state in 1959 🇺🇸 And in 1993, Congress formally apologized for the US role in the overthrow 🤯",
    "pinnedComment": [
      "A kingdom that became a US state 🤯🌺",
      "Did you know the US apologized for this in 1993? 👇",
      "Which island story should we explain next? 🗺️"
    ],
